   "headline": "US stocks rise as battered AI shares recover in a shortened session",
   "when": "Fri 27 Nov · US close",
   "what": "The Dow gained 1.19% to 50,780.64, the S&P 500 1.61% to about 7,298 and the Nasdaq 2.31% to 24,129.50. All three rose on the week, but the S&P 500 and Nasdaq are on track for their worst November since 2008. Chipmakers and large platform companies including Meta rebounded, and Tesla surged. The 10-year Treasury yield closed near 4.94%, up 9 basis points.",
